        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJbsXumQaYf7p7cZEZyQ0SIhP6rs5CLEp25K5bAaJi7RhGdOg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 weeks ago",
        "text": "I have a really bad anxiety disorder, and I’ve never felt more comfortable to go to the dentist. After years of avoidance by fear of judgement, fear of pain… I finally decided to go, and I met the nicest and kindest people. Both hygienists and the dentist we met ( Sara ) were extremely supportive friendly and professional. I can’t wait to get my beautiful smile back! Thank you again!",
        "time": 1769630306,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Olivia Ripa",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100910941665476301687/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW2BI2ISqdElNw_7OGxduuIu5h9bwsU7wXE2bNMsPgGAHH992WZew=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 weeks ago",
        "text": "This clinic is so amazing. They're great with my son who is shy and was scared of the dentist at first! Dr David is so incredible and nice!",
        "time": 1769469531,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Natasha Sylvie Menard",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103073012414300115987/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU3Ws8_7TlyzZeQOZ6xV5py4FIVdZaVOjqnPcGtlQCh6xztJiA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 3,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "I have been using this clinic for 10 year. Organized and friendly front staff.\n\nUnfortunately, permission was not acquired from me as the mother nor the child before removing a tooth. It came as a shock. The relationship with the dentist is completely broken. My 13 year old daughter had her first experience on someone not asking her permission in regards to her bosy.",
        "time": 1764612407,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Brooke L. W.",
