        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLss0-8snsSYFTd17l6q6-c3k-cX0MY-Ag4tumlTVfLwKA9lQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "Absolutely love them.  They took me in an emergency situation very quickly and did an incredible job.\nLove Dr. David, he's such a sweetie.\nPenny W.",
